    slug: "puppy-teething-what-to-expect-and-how-to-help",
    title: "Puppy Teething: What to Expect and How to Help",
    excerpt: "Puppies lose their baby teeth between 3 and 7 months. What happens, what to give them, what to hide and when to call the vet.",
